# Chrysalis

1. **Authoritative rules** are in **`AGENTS.md`**. Read **`DESIGN.md`** and **`ROADMAP.md`** as required there.
2. After substantive changes, run **`pnpm test`** (or the smallest relevant package tests). Respect package boundaries (no circular dependencies; no oracle or environment shortcuts in generated or verify code).
